Bundle members and their SNOMED CT sources:

  snomed_body_structure.txt — Active concept identifiers reachable
                              from 123037004 |Body structure| via
                              active is_a relationships (typeId
                              116680003). Derived from Snapshot/
                              Terminology/sct2_Concept_Snapshot and
                              sct2_Relationship_Snapshot. One numeric
                              concept identifier per line, sorted
                              ascending. Used by the resolver to mask
                              SNOMED corpus rows to the Body structure
                              hierarchy for anatomy-aware site picks.

Source: SNOMED CT US Edition, release 2026-03-01
(SnomedCT_ManagedServiceUS_PRODUCTION_US1000124_20260301T120000Z) or
later. Equivalent International Edition releases produce the same
Body structure subtree because the hierarchy is part of the
International core; the US module adds extensions outside it.

